---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing — Flynt AI"
  description="Three plans built for where you are and where you're going. Every tier includes Flynt's core intelligence system."
>

<div class="pricing-page">

  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="tag">Pricing</div>
      <h1>Start by hand. <span class="accent">Scale with agents.</span></h1>
      <p>Every plan includes the full intelligence engine: live hiring, funding and M&A signals, decision makers, contacts, AI-written outreach on email and LinkedIn. What changes is how much runs without you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Cards -->
  <section class="section pricing-section">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Billing Toggle -->
      <div class="billing-toggle">
        <button class="toggle-btn" id="toggle-monthly" onclick="setBilling('monthly')">Monthly</button>
        <button class="toggle-btn toggle-btn--active" id="toggle-annual" onclick="setBilling('annual')">
          Annual <span class="toggle-badge">Save up to 17%</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid">

        <!-- Lite -->
        <div class="plan" data-plan="lite">
          <div class="plan__header">
            <h3>Lite</h3>
            <p class="plan__tagline">Search and send, by hand. For recruiters who want to pick every company themselves.</p>
            <div class="plan__credit-opts">
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="lite-cr" value="2500" checked /><span>2,500 cr</span></label>
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="lite-cr" value="4000" /><span>4,000 cr</span></label>
            </div>
            <div class="plan__price">
              <span class="plan__dollar">$</span><span class="plan__amount">77</span>
              <span class="plan__period">/mo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="plan__annual-teaser">Switch to annual — save $120/yr</div>
            <div class="plan__annual-info">
              <div class="plan__billing-row">
                <span class="plan__billed-inline">Billed $924/yr</span>
                <span class="plan__info-btn plan__has-tip" tabindex="0" onclick="toggleTip(this)">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M9 8v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="9" cy="5.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                  <span class="plan__tip plan__tip--multi"><span>$77/mo on annual</span><span>Save $120/yr</span></span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://app.tryflynt.ai/" class="btn btn--outline plan__cta">Start free trial</a>
            <p class="plan__sub-cta">7-day trial · Cancel anytime</p>
          </div>
          <div class="plan__features-label">What's Included</div>
          <ul class="plan__features">
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Manual search across jobs, funding and M&A</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Scored hiring managers, verified contacts</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Email and LinkedIn in one sequence</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> AI personalisation & outreach</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> MPC campaigns — pitch candidates</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> CRM, Unified Inbox, Dashboard</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Saved searches</li>
            <li class="plan__note-item">No daily agent. You run the searches.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Starter (featured) -->
        <div class="plan plan--featured" data-plan="starter">
          <div class="plan__badge">Most Popular</div>
          <div class="plan__header">
            <h3>Starter</h3>
            <p class="plan__tagline">One agent, running every morning. For one recruiter who wants pipeline arriving without asking.</p>
            <div class="plan__credit-opts">
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="starter-cr" value="4000" checked /><span>4,000 cr</span></label>
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="starter-cr" value="6000" /><span>6,000 cr</span></label>
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="starter-cr" value="8000" /><span>8,000 cr</span></label>
            </div>
            <div class="plan__price">
              <span class="plan__dollar plan__dollar--featured">$</span><span class="plan__amount plan__amount--featured">127</span>
              <span class="plan__period">/mo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="plan__annual-teaser">Switch to annual — save $240/yr</div>
            <div class="plan__annual-info">
              <div class="plan__billing-row">
                <span class="plan__billed-inline">Billed $1,524/yr</span>
                <span class="plan__info-btn plan__has-tip" tabindex="0" onclick="toggleTip(this)">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M9 8v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="9" cy="5.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                  <span class="plan__tip plan__tip--multi"><span>$127/mo on annual</span><span>Save $240/yr</span></span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://app.tryflynt.ai/" class="btn btn--primary plan__cta">Start free trial</a>
            <p class="plan__sub-cta">7-day trial · Cancel anytime</p>
          </div>
          <div class="plan__features-label">What's Included</div>
          <ul class="plan__features">
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Everything in Lite</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 1 daily hiring agent</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Up to 30 scored leads per run, no limit on runs</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Add a second agent sharing credits, $44/mo</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Signal agent add-on, $49/mo with 1,000 credits</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pro -->
        <div class="plan" data-plan="pro">
          <div class="plan__header">
            <h3>Pro</h3>
            <p class="plan__tagline">Three agents, two kinds of signal. For teams running several searches across several markets.</p>
            <div class="plan__credit-opts">
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="pro-cr" value="8000" checked /><span>8,000 cr</span></label>
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="pro-cr" value="12000" /><span>12,000 cr</span></label>
              <label class="credit-opt"><input type="radio" name="pro-cr" value="16000" /><span>16,000 cr</span></label>
            </div>
            <div class="plan__price">
              <span class="plan__dollar">$</span><span class="plan__amount">247</span>
              <span class="plan__period">/mo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="plan__annual-teaser">Switch to annual — save $600/yr</div>
            <div class="plan__annual-info">
              <div class="plan__billing-row">
                <span class="plan__billed-inline">Billed $2,964/yr</span>
                <span class="plan__info-btn plan__has-tip" tabindex="0" onclick="toggleTip(this)">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M9 8v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="9" cy="5.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                  <span class="plan__tip plan__tip--multi"><span>$247/mo on annual</span><span>Save $600/yr</span></span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://app.tryflynt.ai/" class="btn btn--outline plan__cta">Start free trial</a>
            <p class="plan__sub-cta">7-day trial · Cancel anytime</p>
          </div>
          <div class="plan__features-label">What's Included</div>
          <ul class="plan__features">
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Everything in Starter</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 2 hiring agents + 1 Signal agent</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Funding and M&amp;A included, no add-on</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Up to 6 full agents with 4,000 credits, $147/agent/mo</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Up to 4 agents sharing credits, $44/agent/mo</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> Premium support</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Scale banner -->
      <div class="enterprise-banner">
        <div class="enterprise-banner__left">
          <div class="enterprise-banner__title">
            <span class="enterprise-banner__name">Scale</span>
            <span class="enterprise-banner__tag">Enterprise</span>
          </div>
          <p class="enterprise-banner__desc">For agencies and high-volume teams. Everything in Pro, 12+ agents, unlimited extra agents, custom credit volumes, dedicated onboarding.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:info@tryflynt.ai" class="btn btn--outline enterprise-banner__cta">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>

      <p class="pricing-disclaimer">
        Pricing reflects time saved and consistency gained — not guaranteed outcomes. Flynt prepares opportunity. Results depend on your execution.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Credits Explainer -->
  <section class="section credits-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header section-header--center">
        <div class="tag" style="display: inline-flex; margin-bottom: 16px;">What a credit actually buys</div>
        <h2>Credits cover <span class="accent-word">everything.</span></h2>
        <p>Finding leads, enriching them, writing the outreach, and sending on email and LinkedIn. One balance, no separate fees. Here's what a month looks like.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="compare-table credits-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="compare-table__feature">What you do with each lead</th>
              <th>Credits</th>
              <th>Lite <span class="th-cr">2,500</span></th>
              <th class="compare-table__featured">Starter <span class="th-cr">4,000</span></th>
              <th>Pro <span class="th-cr">8,000</span></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="compare-table__feature">Find and score it</td>
              <td>1.73</td>
              <td>~1,445</td>
              <td class="compare-table__featured">~2,312</td>
              <td>~4,624</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="compare-table__feature">Plus contact details and personalization angles</td>
              <td>3.73</td>
              <td>~670</td>
              <td class="compare-table__featured">~1,072</td>
              <td>~2,144</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="credits-table__highlight">
              <td class="compare-table__feature">
                <strong>Plus email and LinkedIn outreach</strong>
                <span class="credits-table__sub">The typical working pattern</span>
              </td>
              <td><strong>4.73</strong></td>
              <td><strong>~528</strong></td>
              <td class="compare-table__featured"><strong>~845</strong></td>
              <td><strong>~1,691</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="compare-table__feature">Plus AI writing every message on both channels</td>
              <td>6.73</td>
              <td>~371</td>
              <td class="compare-table__featured">~594</td>
              <td>~1,188</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="compare-table__feature">Plus a verified phone number</td>
              <td>14.73</td>
              <td>~169</td>
              <td class="compare-table__featured">~271</td>
              <td>~543</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="credits-note">Most recruiters run the highlighted row: find the lead, get the contact, let Flynt write and send on both channels. On Starter that's around <strong>845 fully worked leads a month</strong>. Run out and your agents pause, then pick up automatically when credits are back. Every action shows what it costs before you spend it.</p>
      <div class="credits-topup">
        <span class="credits-topup__label">Top up any time</span>
        <span class="credits-topup__items">1,000 credits $34 · 2,000 $67 · 4,000 $129 · 8,000 $249 · 16,000 $489 · 32,000 $967</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tier Comparison Table -->
  <section class="section comparison-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header section-header--center">
        <h2>What's <span class="accent-word">included</span> at each level.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="compare-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
