      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Add-ons -->
  <section class="section addons-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header section-header--center">
        <div class="tag">Add-ons</div>
        <h2>Add what you need, <span class="accent-word">when you need it.</span></h2>
        <p>Nothing here is a separate subscription or a separate tool. Add an agent for a busy quarter, top up credits for a big push, drop them when the month is quieter.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="addon-featured-card">
        <div class="addon-featured-card__inner">
          <div class="addon-featured-card__title-row">
            <h3 class="addon-featured-card__name">Phone Number Discovery</h3>
            <span class="addon-badge">Most Requested</span>
          </div>
          <p class="addon-featured-card__price">$197/mo · $187/mo annual</p>
          <p class="addon-featured-card__desc">6,300 credits included — around <strong>787 verified direct dials a month</strong> at roughly $0.25 each. Your agent finds the lead, then keeps going for the number. No separate tool, no manual lookup. <strong class="addon-card__highlight">10–15x cheaper than standalone enrichment tools.</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="addons-grid">
        <div class="addon-mini">
          <h3 class="addon-mini__name">Extra Credits</h3>
          <span class="addon-mini__price">From $34 · all plans</span>
          <p class="addon-mini__desc">1,000 credits for $34 up to 32,000 for $967. One-off when you need a push, or recurring so it refills every renewal.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="addon-mini">
          <h3 class="addon-mini__name">Extra Agent, Sharing Credits</h3>
          <span class="addon-mini__price">$44/mo</span>
          <p class="addon-mini__desc">Another search running daily, drawing on the balance you already have. Starter: one more. Pro: up to four.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="addon-mini">
          <h3 class="addon-mini__name">Extra Full Agent, With Its Own Credits</h3>
          <span class="addon-mini__price">$147/mo · Pro only</span>
          <p class="addon-mini__desc">A complete agent with 4,000 credits of its own, so a new market doesn't eat into an existing one. Up to six.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="addon-mini">
          <h3 class="addon-mini__name">Signal Agent</h3>
          <span class="addon-mini__price">$49/mo · Starter only</span>
          <p class="addon-mini__desc">Funding rounds and acquisitions in your market, watched around the clock. Comes with 1,000 credits. Already included on Pro.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stop Monitoring Manually -->
  <section class="section signals-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header section-header--center">
        <h2>Stop monitoring signals <span class="accent-word">manually.</span></h2>
        <p>Recruiters use 4–5 separate tools to track what Flynt monitors automatically — and spend 4 hours every morning doing it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="compare-table signals-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="compare-table__feature">Signal</th>
              <th>Manual Tools Required</th>
              <th>Monthly Cost</th>
              <th>Daily Research Time</th>
